	<appendix xml:id="app-author-master-checklist">
		<title>Master Completion Checklist</title>

		<p>
			<term>Data and Governance</term>
			<ul>
					<li><p>[ ] Confirm IRB or institutional authorization.</p></li>
					<li><p>[ ] Confirm redistribution status separately from analysis status.</p></li>
					<li><p>[ ] Complete corpus and item-version inventory.</p></li>
					<li><p>[ ] Resolve all logged-item to source-version mappings.</p></li>
			</ul>
		</p>

		<p>
			<term>Implementation</term>
			<ul>
					<li><p>[ ] Complete F10 attempt outcomes.</p></li>
					<li><p>[ ] Complete F12 flat error-profile exports.</p></li>
					<li><p>[ ] Complete F18 item covariates and feedback-policy metadata.</p></li>
					<li><p>[ ] Complete F20 unified modeling and diagnostic tables.</p></li>
					<li><p>[ ] Resolve F11 entropy inclusion or removal.</p></li>
					<li><p>[ ] Freeze tests, fixtures, and software release.</p></li>
			</ul>
		</p>

		<p>
			<term>Analysis</term>
			<ul>
					<li><p>[ ] Freeze attempt unit and inclusion rules.</p></li>
					<li><p>[ ] Complete anchor-validation analysis.</p></li>
					<li><p>[ ] Complete manual audit and synthetic fault tests.</p></li>
					<li><p>[ ] Complete prespecified sensitivity analyses.</p></li>
					<li><p>[ ] Select the smallest sufficient baseline feature set.</p></li>
					<li><p>[ ] Generate all tables and figures programmatically.</p></li>
			</ul>
		</p>

		<p>
			<term>Writing and Submission</term>
			<ul>
					<li><p>[ ] Complete systematic related-work search.</p></li>
					<li><p>[ ] Replace every bracketed stub and placeholder.</p></li>
					<li><p>[ ] Remove all author to-do remarks before submission.</p></li>
					<li><p>[ ] Audit claim boundaries and causal language.</p></li>
					<li><p>[ ] Adapt length, abstract, and supplementary materials to the target journal.</p></li>
					<li><p>[ ] Prepare data, code, software, and AI-use statements.</p></li>
			</ul>
		</p>
